note Control for inline-new.om with every inline removed: accepted, runs (section 4 line 97).
note Contract section 4 line 94: an inline function must contain no new (error 9). The same text
note without inline (inline-new-plain.om) is accepted and prints 3.
om2
fn f a ulong to ulong
b = new ulong 4 0
put b 0 a
ret get b 0
end
fn main to int
pu f 3
ret 0
end
